Given that $\triangle ABC$ is an acute triangle, vector $\overrightarrow{m} = (\cos(A + \frac{\pi}{3}), \sin(A + \frac{\pi}{3}))$, $\overrightarrow{n} = (\cos B, \sin B)$, and $\overrightarrow{m} \perp \overrightarrow{n}$.

(Ⅰ) Find the value of $A-B$;  
