Given an ellipse $C$: $\frac{x^{2}}{a^{2}} + \frac{y^{2}}{b^{2}} = 1 (a > b > 0)$ passing through the point $(0,4)$, with an eccentricity of $\frac{3}{5}$
1. Find the equation of $C$;
