Given that $|\vec{a}| = 2$, $|\vec{b}| = 1$, and $(2\vec{a} - 3\vec{b}) \cdot (2\vec{a} + \vec{b}) = 9$.

(I) Find the angle $\theta$ between vectors $\vec{a}$ and $\vec{b}$;

