Given vectors $\overrightarrow {a}=( \sqrt {3}\sin x, m+\cos x)$ and $\overrightarrow {b}=(\cos x, -m+\cos x)$, and a function $f(x)= \overrightarrow {a}\cdot \overrightarrow {b}$
