In the diagram, $\angle PQR = 90^\circ$. A line PS bisects $\angle PQR$, and $\angle PQS = y^\circ$. If $\angle SQR = 2x^\circ$ and $\angle PQS = 2y^\circ$, what is the value of $x + y$?

